From 0cc053eb4040f8b1aaf648b5b5d23213ea6ebdda Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelpro09_Dev <aloplop090708@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 12:15:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Nocturno save, hide duplicate Video corto entries, fix
 color filters via real Xiaomi LUT data
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- RawJpegFix: read the active color-lookup filter on demand from
  com.android.camera.effect.n (getEffectForSaving + getLookupTableName)
  instead of hooking Lm2/b construction, which never fires since filters
  are pre-cached rather than constructed per-selection. Applies the real
  Xiaomi LUT PNG (res/raw/normal_*.png) via a standard Hald-CLUT bilinear
  lookup, matching what the live preview shader does.
- RawJpegFix.finishAsync: fall back to publishing a brand-new MediaStore
  entry when no pending placeholder row is found after retries (fixes
  Nocturno-mode captures never appearing in the gallery).
- k3/c.smali, zf/v.smali: force support() to false for both registrations
  of the duplicate Vídeo corto module (moduleId 0xa1 and 0xb7), which is
  broken even in stock MIUI.
